            "pk": "18396761596076932",
            "text": "🚀 We are thrilled to announce the successful completion of our free Arduino course for beginners! This amazing journey was made possible through our collaboration with Makerspace Astana and Astana Hub. \n\n⚡️ Over the past few weeks, participants explored the world of Arduino, learning how to create amazing projects and harness the power of technology. From blinking LEDs to designing smart gadgets, our students showcased remarkable creativity and dedication.\n\n✨ A huge thank you to our fantastic instructor and our enthusiastic participants!\n\n🔥 Stay tuned for more workshops and courses. The journey of innovation and learning continues!"
